{"title":"EYEWEAR","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003eIndulge in the epitome of luxury with Datum Dahleez's exclusive eyewear collection, where sophistication meets unparalleled craftsmanship. Each pair of sunglasses is meticulously handcrafted, showcasing the brand's commitment to opulence and precision. From the finest Grade 5 Japanese titanium to exquisite .925 sterling silver accents, every detail is designed to elevate your style while ensuring optimal performance. Experience the perfect fusion of aesthetics and functionality, as our sunglasses offer superior clarity and complete UVA\/UVB protection. Embrace the allure of Datum Dahleez and make a statement that transcends time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-36g","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 36G","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 36G, the first beveled rimless frame for the collection. Available in a curated palette of custom horn and carbon fiber hues and feature signature EB spring hinges and mesh trim details, plated in Silver, White Gold, and 24K Gold. Adjustable, interchangable titanium and silicone nosepads are included. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 36G is complete with Ettore Datum Dahleez signature engraved 3mm thick lenses with a unique beveled polished edge and anti-reflective coatings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49816543625563,"sku":"36G-BK\/24K","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/36G-BK-SS_Front.jpg?v=1778573556"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-36h","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 36H","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 36H, a bold and sporty rimless frame shape. Available in a curated palette of custom horn and carbon fiber hues and feature signature EB spring hinges and mesh trim details, plated in Silver, White Gold, and 24K Gold. Adjustable, interchangable titanium and silicone nosepads are included. Datum Dahleez Eyewear model 36H is complete with Ettore Datum Dahleez signature engraved 3mm thick lenses with polished edge and anti-reflective coatings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49816573837659,"sku":"36H-BK\/24K","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/36H-BBS-SS_Front.jpg?v=1778573735"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-69","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 69","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 69 is a powerful and commanding square sunglass, sculptecd from thick Japanese cellulose acetate. Hand finished with laminated mesh grill pattern temple wire core and metal EB logo details. Datum Dahleez Eyewear model 69 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49816702746971,"sku":"69-BK\/WG","price":860.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/69-BK-WG_Front.jpg?v=1778574281"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-56","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 56","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 56 distills the collection’s design philosophy to its purest form – an ultra-light, all-titanium round frame that showcases material precision, technical mastery and understated elegance. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 56 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49833554444635,"sku":"56-14K","price":990.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/56-14K_Angle.jpg?v=1778573957"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-70","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 70","description":"\u003cp\u0