55\/files\/71-BGN-WG_Front.jpg?v=1778574762"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-101","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 101","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 101 introduces a contemporary navigator silhouette with a combination acetate and titanium front grounded in classic proportions. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49834823844187,"sku":"101-MBK\/24K-BK","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/101-14K-BK_Angle.jpg?v=1778574943"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-102","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 102","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 102 introduces a contemporary navigator silhouette with a combination acetate and titanium front grounded in classic proportions. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 102 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49834852024667,"sku":"102-MBK\/24K-BK","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/102-14K-BK_Angle.jpg?v=1778575095"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-50","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 50","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 50 introduces a modern round silhouette that explores a sophisticated balance of structure and warmth through its titanium and acetate combination front. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 50 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49835069604187,"sku":"50-BK\/14K","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/50-BBS-BP_Angle.jpg?v=1778573211"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-36c","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 36 C","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 36C, the first-ever rimless frame for the collection in a classic square lens shape. Available in a curated palette of custom horn and carbon fiber hues and feature signature EB spring hinges and mesh trim details, plated in Silver, White Gold, and 24K Gold. Adjustable, interchangable titanium and silicone nosepads are included. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 36C is Complete with Ettore Datum Dahleez signature engraved 3mm thick lenses with polished edge and anti-reflective coatings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49852780544347,"sku":"36C-BK\/24K","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":fals