t feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 111 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52963430236507,"sku":"111-MBK\/24K","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/111-14K_Angle.jpg?v=1778575512"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/eyewear.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}